  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 07 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 0E}这怎么行……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3B 01}依靠同伴就是这么回事。\n我想是的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 86 15 01 13 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那只蝴蝶……\n能平安地飞到出口吗……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}希望能飞出去{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}也许飞不出去{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 85 0D}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}嗯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 8C 0D}或许是这样……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A1 0D}看到那只蝴蝶时……\n我心里难受极了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:9:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}但我觉得，\n不能亲手改变它的命运……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:9:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}如果它无法靠自己的力量逃脱，\n我便该一直守望，直到它死去……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 13 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 0E}可我早就已经\n放弃了死神的职责啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}既然如此，\n放走那只蝴蝶也没有关系。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:10:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_0092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}若是凭自己无法摆脱的困境，\n就应该寻求帮助。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:10:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_0092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 05 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……这是你们教会我的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 01}……这样啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那只蝴蝶，就像被命运卷入此地，\n在生命即将消逝之际\n苦苦挣扎的你们……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}也是被我困住的玲，\n以及无处可去的我自己……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:12:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A1 0D}让我难受极了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}能放走它真好{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}我们不会死的{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B3 11}嗯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 0E 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}说得没错。\n既然知道了，\n就不想什么都不做……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B3 11}嗯……\n那只蝴蝶虽然虚弱，\n也凭自己的力量飞了起来。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:15:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}生命真是坚强啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 80 0D}谢谢……\n我由衷地感谢你们两位。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3A 01}能看到你这副表情就够了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:17:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}好了，委托也算完成了。\n伊丽莎白小姐总是叮嘱个没完，\n只能麻烦你去保健室领报酬了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_725.bf.json:17:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 93 01}别忘了啊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
